---
const designDecisions = [
  {
    title: 'No spending categories or tags',
    description:
      'The transaction description is free text and carries that information. Categories add friction at entry time and a taxonomy to maintain, and this project cares about balances and accountability rather than spending analysis.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Statements are snapshots, not live views',
    description:
      'A statement is a document you hand to someone, so its numbers are frozen when it’s generated and labelled with that timestamp. Correcting something means issuing a new statement, not silently changing an old one.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Soft deletes everywhere',
    description:
      'Wallets, transactions, and members are never hard-deleted, so a balance can always be reconciled against its history. Attachments are the one exception — deleting one removes the file from object storage permanently.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Timezone lives on the wallet',
    description:
      'Period boundaries are computed server-side from the wallet’s timezone rather than the viewer’s clock, so "this month" means the same thing to everyone looking at the same wallet.',
  },
];
---

<section id="design-decisions" class="border-border border-t">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-foreground text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl">Design decisions</h2>
        <p class="text-foreground/70 mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg">
          Some things are deliberately absent. If you're evaluating this against other finance apps, these are the
          trade-offs.
        </p>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/illustrations/design-choices.svg"
        alt=""
        aria-hidden="true"
        loading="lazy"
        width="400"
        height="280"
        class="mx-auto w-full max-w-sm object-contain lg:max-w-md"
      />
    </div>

    <dl class="mt-12 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {
        designDecisions.map((decision) => (
          <div>
            <dt class="font-heading text-foreground text-lg font-semibold">{decision.title}</dt>
            <dd class="text-foreground/70 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">{decision.description}</dd>
          </div>
        ))
      }
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
